<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Ireland's EBS names new head of marketing.</title>
<headline>Ireland's EBS names new head of marketing.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>EBS Building Society said on Wednesday that it had appointed Michael Keane as general manager of marketing with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Keane joins EBS from National Irish Bank, the Irish arm of National Australia Bank.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
